Content:
for bonus points:  add a turn on each coil in both steps - so instead of passing the laces over each other twice at first it becomes thrice...  same for the loops phase (yes it works for both major methods to do the knot, just add a pass on whichever phase)

aand that knot doesn't budge without severe provocation  ('s like triple-knotting without that 'impossible to undo fast without a knife' bit) 

pull that tight
